{"text": "Ticket ITSD-48213 - Offboarding: Cassius Holloway\n\nField\tValue\n\nStatus\tClosed\n\nPriority\tHigh\n\nRequester\tStacy-Ann Thackeray (HR), sthackeray@ravenmoor.example\n\nAssignee\tObinna Nwachukwu, Bluff City Managed Systems\n\nOpened\t2026-02-18 09:02 Central\n\nClosed\t2026-02-27 16:40 Central\n\nSummary\n\nEmployee C. Holloway (ID E-20417, Platform Engineering, manager Yevgenia Markova) resigned Feb 17. Last day Friday, February 20, 2026. Reason given to HR: he is joining Tessellate Data Labs, a direct competitor, so Legal asked for same-day access removal. HR note, not for the team channel: he had been on a PIP since January.\n\nAccess\n\nAccount\tIdentifier\tStep\tWho / When\tResult\n\nSSO (Okta)\tcholloway\tDisabled\tON, 2/20 17:05\tOK\n\nVPN\tcert rmg-vpn-cholloway-03\tRevoked\tON, 2/20 17:06\tlast connected from 198.51.100.77\n\nGitLab (https://git.ravenmoor.example/cholloway)\tpersonal access token glpat-Xw4Tq9ZrL2mVb8Ns\tRevoked\tON, 2/20 17:11\t2 deploy keys also removed\n\nAWS IAM\tsvc-etl-cassius\tRotated\tL. Rosenthal, 2/23\tkey was still active - see comments\n\nWi-Fi\tguest PSK Raven-Guest-0226\tRotated\tON, 2/23\n\nShared mailbox\tplatform-alerts@ravenmoor.example\tRemoved\tON, 2/20\n\nHardware\n\nAsset\tIdentifier\tNotes\n\nLaptop, MacBook Pro 14\tS/N C02ZK4QWMD6T; host RMG-MBP-0417\tWi-Fi MAC 3C:22:FB:9A:41:0E; Ethernet MAC 3c-22-fb-9a-41-0f\n\nPhone\tIMEI 356942523595919\tcompany line (901) 555-0157, ported out at his request\n\nYubiKey 5C NFC\tserial 19884207\treturned\n\nBadge\t#004417\tdisabled 2/20; last door event 2/20 16:52\n\nMonitor\ttag RMG-MON-1188\tstays at his home until the box arrives\n\nTimeline\n\n- 2/18 - Shipping box and UPS label sent to his home, 2208 Cooper Young Lane, Memphis, TN 38104. Label 1Z 84W 07E 03 9921 4470.\n\n- 2/20 - Cassius signed out. Laptop on macOS 15.2 with FileVault; recovery key escrowed. Local account password he gave us to unlock it: tr0ub4dor&Grits.\n\n- 2/23 - Lior Rosenthal (Security) found the service key above used on Feb 21 at 02:14 from 2001:db8:41c:9::2f and again from 10.40.12.186. Second address is our own CI runner. First one is unexplained. Logged as SEC-2026-0031 for the SOC 2 CC6.2 evidence folder.\n\n- 2/24 - Markova confirmed nothing in Slack or Jira needs to be reassigned. His personal address for the COBRA packet: cass.holloway@mailbox.example, cell 901.555.0122.\n\n- 2/27 - Laptop received and wiped by Obinna. Monitor still pending.\n\nComments\n\nYevgenia: please do not delete his home directory until March 20, we need two notebooks out of it.\n\nStacy-Ann: final paycheck goes out 3/6; Ravenmoor Analytics Group (Ravenmoor) will deduct $240.00 if the monitor is not back by then.", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "384 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Cassius Holloway", "Stacy-Ann Thackeray", "Obinna Nwachukwu", "Yevgenia Markova", "Lior Rosenthal", "Markova", "Yevgenia", "Stacy-Ann", "Ravenmoor"], "companies": ["Ravenmoor", "Bluff City Managed Systems", "Tessellate Data Labs", "ravenmoor.example", "Ravenmoor Analytics Group"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Memphis", "Cooper Young Lane", "Ravenmoor"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["PIP", "COBRA packet"], "names": ["Cassius Holloway", "Stacy-Ann Thackeray", "Obinna Nwachukwu", "Yevgenia Markova", "Lior Rosenthal", "Markova", "Yevgenia", "Stacy-Ann", "Raven"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.7999999970197678, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 33537.10000000149, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 7, "end": 17, "text": "ITSD-48213", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "ITSD-48213"}, {"start": 33, "end": 49, "text": "Cassius Holloway", "kind": "person", "so